<section>
    <h2>About Hood Queen</h2>

    <p>
        Built from struggle. Worn with purpose.
    </p>

    <p>
        Hood Queen is more than clothing. It is a movement created for
        those who turned pain into power, obstacles into strength, and
        their story into their purpose.
    </p>

    <p>
        The hood made us. Royalty became us.
    </p>
</section>


<section>
    <h2>Our Founder</h2>

    <p>
        Founded by Vanessa Navarro, Hood Queen was created from real
        experiences, resilience, and the belief that where you come from
        does not limit where you can go.
    </p>

    <p>
        Hood Queen represents loyalty, ambition, family, growth, and
        becoming the person you were meant to be.
    </p>
</section>


<section>
    <h2>The Hood Queen 14 Bonds</h2>

    <div>
        <p>1. Loyalty Over Popularity</p>
        <p>2. Respect Earns Respect</p>
        <p>3. Family Comes First</p>
        <p>4. Hustle With Purpose</p>
        <p>5. Never Forget Where You Came From</p>
        <p>6. Turn Pain Into Power</p>
        <p>7. Keep Your Crown Through The Storm</p>
        <p>8. Stay True To Yourself</p>
        <p>9. Protect Your Peace</p>
        <p>10. Build, Don't Destroy</p>
        <p>11. Rise And Bring Others With You</p>
        <p>12. Believe In Your Vision</p>
        <p>13. Create Your Own Legacy</p>
        <p>14. Royalty Is Earned Through Character</p>
    </div>
</section>


<section>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>

    <p>
        Hood Queen exists to inspire people to embrace their story,
        own their power, and wear their journey with pride.
    </p>
</section>


